{"detail": {"templateUuid": "f06c8c423bd44fb88448721683473a12", "projectUuid": "1d57d244121b4e0fac9985b4e57979c1", "name": "不要在凯里看表", "description": "在黔东南，时间不是用来看表的，是用来过节的。\n\t\n《不要在凯里看表》是一部用 AIGC 完成的苗侗非遗短片。我们把苗绣、银饰、酸汤、斗牛、村BA、凯里方言和苗侗风情园，放进一个折叠起来的影像宇宙里。\n\t\n它不是一支传统非遗的旅游广告。我们更想把它做成一个故事：一个人在熟悉又陌生的凯里重新看见家乡，看见节日、手艺、烟火气，也看见那些仍然活在今天的民族文化。\n\t\n尝试把它作为 AI 非遗创生影像的一次奇幻之行——“”越是民族的，越是世界的“；这一次，我们用 AI 来讲。", "coverUrl": "/assets/2107e603f3999400.webp", "finalOutput": "https://libtv-res.liblib.art/upload-images/d4a7a9586c13499a8538afa624ab8430/9a18d2ef9987a0bec5c33a49d709045114f9e93a.mp4", "snapshotId": 22535, "auditStatus": 1, "ownerId": 5919496, "ownerUuid": "d4a7a9586c13499a8538afa624ab8430", "avatar": "/assets/3e3bb6164390ba95.webp", "nickname": "有無劇院", "isLike": false, "likeCount": 5, "tags": [{"id": 3040, "code": "test", "tagLabel": "广告导演请就位", "parentTag": 0, "categoryId": 0, "path": "3040/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 10, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 5}, {"id": 3043, "code": "test", "tagLabel": "3-非遗创生", "parentTag": 3040, "categoryId": 0, "path": "3040/3043", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 10, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 5}, {"id": 1000, "code": "selected", "tagLabel": "精选画布", "parentTag": 0, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1000/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 1, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}, {"id": 1303, "code": "short_animation", "tagLabel": "动画短片", "parentTag": 1300, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1300/1303/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 3, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}], "userTags": [{"tagId": 5002, "name": "专业", "icon": "/assets/a31a6cc391430f72.webp", "primaryIcon": "/assets/7097b07d2df12cc8.webp", "desc": "LibTV专业作者", "verifyLevel": 2}], "score": 0, "socialMediaUrl": "96 【用AI讲一个苗侗非遗故事《不要在凯里看表》 - 雀鸟 | 小红书 - 你的生活兴趣社区】 😆 T206ASP08xb0MsW 😆 https://www.xiaohongshu.com/discovery/item/6a3e77ac0000000021015c4f?source=webshare&xhsshare=pc_web&xsec_token=ABYqRsVptQ7x1wiUloFIcBVfFIA4iqBd8nFmNqPluX6T8=&xsec_source=pc_share", "c